flowchart LR
  X["Protocol or function<br/>in the question"] --> A{"Does it carry or act on<br/>USER traffic passing through?"}
  A -->|Yes| D["<b>DATA</b><br/>forwarding, ACL, NAT,<br/>QoS, encapsulation, TTL"]
  A -->|No| B{"Do DEVICES exchange it<br/>to build tables?"}
  B -->|Yes| C["<b>CONTROL</b><br/>OSPF, BGP, EIGRP, STP,<br/>ARP, LACP, CDP/LLDP, HSRP"]
  B -->|No| E{"Does a human, NMS or<br/>script configure / monitor the box?"}
  E -->|Yes| M["<b>MANAGEMENT</b><br/>SSH, SNMP, NETCONF,<br/>RESTCONF, syslog, NTP, AAA"]
